# Screenshot probes written next to the pages so relative paths resolve
.__shot.html

# lab/ used to be excluded wholesale, because the PCB model is derived from a
# board layout whose patent disclosure is still a draft. That call was taken
# deliberately on 2026-09-07 and went the other way: the product page's hero is
# the sequence, and the sequence cannot ship without the model it is built from.
#
# So lab/ is published, with two exceptions. Each pattern is on its own line
# because .gitignore has no inline comments — a trailing "# why" is read as part
# of the pattern, which is how NOTES.md got staged the first time.
#
# Internal reasoning about the model, not an asset of it:
lab/model/NOTES.md
# Nothing matches this today, but a source file is not a deliverable:
lab/model/*.blend*
